                            <comment id="15307508" author="githubbot" created="Tue, 31 May 2016 09:43:59 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Github user prabhjyotsingh commented on the pull request:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/incubator-zeppelin/pull/933#issuecomment-222641325&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/incubator-zeppelin/pull/933#issuecomment-222641325&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    @swkimme I think this is failing because you are trying to get paragraph result i.e. `p.getResult()` or `p2.getResult()` without running any of the paragraph.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    try having &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;        note.runAll();&lt;br/&gt;
        while(p.isTerminated()==false || p.getResult()==null) Thread.yield();&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;        importedNote.runAll();&lt;br/&gt;
        while(p2.isTerminated()==false || p2.getResult()==null) Thread.yield();&lt;/p&gt;

</comment>
